  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WITNESS - Using Video and Technology to Protect and Promote Human Rights in Africa, Phase 2, 2022-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WITNESS - Using Video and Technology to Protect and Promote Human Rights in Africa, 2022-2023 -
-Increased knowledge and capacity of grassroots actors (e.g. vulnerable communities, human rights defenders, activists, and journalists) across Africa to utilize video and technology to create and share trustworthy information, expose abuses, combat discrimination and exclusion, and hold the powerful to account
-Enhanced responsiveness and action by systems-level actors (e.g. technology companies) to the needs, rights, and potential harms of technology for marginalized groups across Africa when developing platforms, products, laws, and policies related to civic space and digital resilience</narrative>
  </description>
